{# ── Chapter: Takeaway ── #}
<section class="case-chapter" data-chapter="takeaway">
  <h2>Remember</h2>
  <div class="case-takeaway">
    <h3>Key takeaways</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="tone-junior">An AI call with only a success path leaves the loading spinner running forever the moment the request fails — always write the failure branch, not just the happy path.</div>
        <div class="tone-mid">Give every model API call a timeout and a caught error state with a working retry, and add a non-AI fallback (raw content, cached result) so the feature stays usable when the model isn't available.</div>
        <div class="tone-staff">Respect Retry-After on 429s, cap automatic retries with backoff before falling through to the degraded state, and monitor the AI call path's own error rate so a provider outage pages someone before it becomes a support-ticket wave.</div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
